# The Seven
tags: heroes, benchmark
stimulus: Seven rounds of seven movements, seven reps each.
note: The original posting gives men's loads only; the women's loads are the commonly used ones.
7 rounds for time
  7 Handstand push-up
  7 Thruster 135/95 lb
  7 Knees-to-elbow
  7 Deadlift 245/165 lb
  7 Burpee
  7 Kettlebell swing 2/1.5 pood
  7 Pull-up
